Thu Jun 25 14:13:29 UTC 2026 - Eyad Issa <eyadlorenzo@gmail.com>

- Update to version 0.6.0:
  * Toolchains are now defined in a muon script
  * Added support for tcc, clang-cl, ccache and sccache
  * Added muon help command
  * Added DAP debugger protocol support & dcmake integration
  * Added wayland module

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Aug  4 13:46:07 UTC 2025 - Eyad Issa <eyadlorenzo@gmail.com>

- Update to version 0.5.0:
  * Initial LSP support: completions, diagnostics, URI handling,
	file tracking
  * Wrap system overhaul with async support and new subcommands
  * Added pkg-config-exec backend, dynamic backend selection,
	fallback improvements
  * Enhanced subproject handling: fetch/update commands, improved
	variable access
  * Major analyzer improvements: location tracking,
	go-to-definition, relaxed parsing
  * Improved dependency handling: gtest, dl, appleframeworks,
	libarchive, pkgconf
  * Support for configure_file() in script mode and improved
	ninja integration
  * Added meson_version compatibility checks and override
	mechanisms
  * Cross-compilation and linker detection improvements
  * Logging framework updates, better diagnostics and error
	messages
  * Numerous bug fixes, cleanups, and internal refactors 

